WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.592
Use this slide as guided practice Work through the
task in small steps and explain

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:11.114
why each step produces the result you see Check your
understanding Can

00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:17.241
you read a condition Explain what makes it true or
false Can

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:23.652
you identify the block Point to the indented lines
controlled by the statement Can

00:00:23.678 --> 00:00:24.665
you trace a loop
